{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1140039-w20-storytellers-vault-maybe","id":1140039,"title":"W20 Storytellers Vault (Maybe?)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-09-13T17:04:16-07:00","id":1140039,"title":"W20 Storytellers Vault (Maybe?)","content":"So the Vampire 20 Storytellers Vault seems to be doing really well. If they decide to extend it to other game lines, what would you find interesting for someone to do some write ups about?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1619-derzhuzad","name":"Derzhuzad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1619_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-13T20:31:43-07:00","id":1140072,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Derzhuzad</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1140039-w20-storytellers-vault-maybe#post1140039\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So the Vampire 20 Storytellers Vault seems to be doing really well. If they decide to extend it to other game lines, what would you find interesting for someone to do some write ups about?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I kind of wish they made a Children of Gaia Tribebook, its really strange how with two whole cycles of tribebooks they never wrote one. I mean sure there's vicious rumours about one set at Woodstock and has a rite that violates the Litany, but that clearly didn't happen.(seriously a COG Tribebook that doesn't suck. That actually covers being a warrior for Peace. Having camp in the various &quot;Join other Fera groups&quot;<br /> <br /> A mutichanging breed faction setup for North America.<br /> <br /> The Great Werewolf Campaign: A multigenerational Campaign like the Great Pendragon Campaign for Pendragon where you play out multiple generations of Werewolf as the world changes and you fight it. I think the Giovanni chronicles would be the closest to something WW produced<br /> <br /> <br /> Tribebook Croatan with the obligatory &quot;what if they never died&quot;<br /> <br /> A redoing of Way of the Wolf based on more modern understanding of animal behaviour, bonus points if you can add other species.<br /> <br /> <br /> Some New Fera, I mean I'm always a sucker for reading over someone's new werecreature. <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-14T10:50:04-07:00","id":1140238,"title":"","content":"I'd like to see an expansion of some of the Changing Breeds to encompass other cultural sources as well. For example, I am thinking the European, and possibly Siberian, Gurahl may have different views and terminology for their society being fairly, geographically and demographically, isolated from the North American Gurahl.<br /> <br /> Another thing I'd like to see would be stories, background, etc for Changing Breeds that could fit into <i>Shattered Dreams</i>. I'm thinking like a historic Breedbook for each of the Fera.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Lead Writer for the Savage Age of Werewolf: the Apocalypse: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/428750/Ghost-Lineages-The-Advanced-Players-Guide-to-the-Savage-Age\" target=\"_blank\">Ghost Lineages</a>, <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/312700/The-Rise-of-the-Garou-The-Savage-Age-Volume-Two\" target=\"_blank\">Rise of the Garou</a>, <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/331302/Tools-of-Extinction-The-Savage-Age-Volume-Three\" target=\"_blank\">Tools of Extinction</a>, <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/352717/Tribebook-Wlewa\" target=\"_blank\">Tribebook: Wlewa</a>.<br /> <br /> Want RPGs in libraries? Check out my book, <a href=\"http://www.abc-clio.com/ABC-CLIOCorporate/product.aspx?pc=A3951P\" target=\"_blank\">Dragons in the Stacks</a>. Now with <a href=\"http://www.ennie-awards.com/blog/2015-ennie-award-nominees-and-spotlight-winners/\" target=\"_blank\">awards</a>!<br /> \u200b","edited":{"userid":1813,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1813-grimjaws","user":"grimjaws","date":".  Readability 09-14-2017, 03:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1813-grimjaws","name":"grimjaws","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1813_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-14T14:58:11-07:00","id":1140326,"title":"","content":"So is this just an in general wish list?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-14T15:23:41-07:00","id":1140336,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CeltSPZ</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1140039-w20-storytellers-vault-maybe?p=1140326#post1140326\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So is this just an in general wish list?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah. If the platform is opened to all of the storytellers and tt-gamers who contribute to the boards already, what would you like to see someone give some real effort to?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1619-derzhuzad","name":"Derzhuzad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1619_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-14T18:14:24-07:00","id":1140379,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1140039-w20-storytellers-vault-maybe?p=1140072#post1140072\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A redoing of Way of the Wolf based on more modern understanding of animal behaviour, bonus points if you can add other species.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Some key points on that note:<br /> <br /> - Other animals are probably not &quot;stuck in the present&quot; with no concept of past or future.<br /> - Get away from terms like &quot;sentient&quot; or &quot;sapient&quot;. They don't really describe anything useful. Well, unless you're using sentient in the ethical debate sense, where it denotes the capacity to feel pain.<br /> - Emphasize the environment in which the wolf lives, and contrast it with the type of social environment to which humans live.<br /> <br /> Generally, though, WW, especially in Werewolf books, at least has had a track record of not having an arbitrarily low Intelligence rating set aside just for animals that aren't humans, has emphasized that they'll pay more attention to non-linguistic cues that humans typically tune out, and has also served to remind others that wolf packs are families and captive wolf packs are prison gangs, so they have that going for them right away.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-14T18:49:26-07:00","id":1140386,"title":"","content":"what i mean specifically is I'd love to see another book on rping beast born fera.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-15T12:05:27-07:00","id":1140586,"title":"","content":"I've mentioned this on another threaf, but i'd love more content on lvl 6. What does it take to reach it, how the changing breeds view someone of that rank, plot points, lvl 6 fetishes as well as gifts (not every tribe or fera breed has a lvl 6 gift, and there are no lvl 6 garou breed gifts).<br /> <br /> Sometimes I'm in the mood for epic and so i'd love an expansion on what it means to be lvl 6 for all the changing breeds. Similar to how &quot;Hammer and Klaive&quot; or &quot;Guardians of the Caerns&quot; expanded on their topics for both Garou tribes and the fera.<br /> <br /> <br /> I'd also love an updated combat book with more research put into it (I mean Captain Kirks axe chop did more dmg then an elbow or knee....)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1179,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","user":"CeltSPZ","date":". 09-16-2017, 01:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-16T14:12:40-07:00","id":1140902,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1140039-w20-storytellers-vault-maybe?p=1140386#post1140386\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">what i mean specifically is I'd love to see another book on rping beast born fera.</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought that Changing Ways was supposed to have a section about that, at least. I guess we'll see in the next few weeks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-16T14:38:26-07:00","id":1140906,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1140039-w20-storytellers-vault-maybe?p=1140902#post1140902\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I thought that Changing Ways was supposed to have a section about that, at least. I guess we'll see in the next few weeks.</div> </div> </div> </div>It should, and on metis as well.<br /> <br /> It'll be an interesting read, especially as its been in production for a good while now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-16T16:31:52-07:00","id":1140923,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1140039-w20-storytellers-vault-maybe?p=1140902#post1140902\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I thought that Changing Ways was supposed to have a section about that, at least. I guess we'll see in the next few weeks.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well if an offical book covers it. So be it. Still I'd love to see more on rping beast born since its such an alien setup.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-18T17:29:45-07:00","id":1141597,"title":"","content":"I'd seriously consider writing up my (non-canonical) War of Rage histories - flesh out all those bits that I couldn't fit into the book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ofii86boiyk38ng/DtDRandomForms.zip\" target=\"_blank\">Open the gates of Hell: Random Demon Generator.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1X6qQzoAPrSRNzl3cQcMWasoPv3eK56sIlAOTeay61No/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Gather an army of Rage! Random Garou Generator.</a><br /> Shapeshifting Historian<br /> Writer - Werewolf: the Apocalypse, Werewolf: the Forsaken, Exalted 3e, TC: \u00c6on","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/167-nikink","name":"nikink","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-18T17:52:38-07:00","id":1141602,"title":"","content":"I'd read it, I mean...is there anything legally wrong with you just doing up some fan made stuff?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-18T17:59:23-07:00","id":1141604,"title":"","content":"Nope - I'm no lawyer, but my understanding is that so long as I'm absolutely clear it's just fan-work, not-to-be-considered-official-in-any-way, totally-non-canonocal, then I should be as ok to write whatever as any other fan. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ofii86boiyk38ng/DtDRandomForms.zip\" target=\"_blank\">Open the gates of Hell: Random Demon Generator.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1X6qQzoAPrSRNzl3cQcMWasoPv3eK56sIlAOTeay61No/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Gather an army of Rage! Random Garou Generator.</a><br /> Shapeshifting Historian<br /> Writer - Werewolf: the Apocalypse, Werewolf: the Forsaken, Exalted 3e, TC: \u00c6on","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/167-nikink","name":"nikink","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-18T19:42:18-07:00","id":1141626,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Derzhuzad</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1140039-w20-storytellers-vault-maybe#post1140039\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">what would you find interesting for someone to do some write ups about?</div> </div> </div> </div>A children of Gaia tribebook that doesnt suck. It almost write itself with the setup of a sort of &quot;court martial&quot; for the idiot POV pack from the revised Tribebook.<br /> <br /> In which an elder Philodox children of Gaian Garou has to determine if they will strip them on their rank and deed name (maybe even kick them out of the tribe) and proceed to grab any conception the original book threw at them and explain how &quot;no, that not how our tribe work you idiots&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2179-lokiravenspeak","name":"LokiRavenSpeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-18T20:40:29-07:00","id":1141640,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LokiRavenSpeak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1140039-w20-storytellers-vault-maybe?p=1141626#post1141626\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A children of Gaia tribebook that doesnt suck. It almost write itself with the setup of a sort of &quot;court martial&quot; for the idiot POV pack from the revised Tribebook.<br /> <br /> In which an elder Philodox children of Gaian Garou has to determine if they will strip them on their rank and deed name (maybe even kick them out of the tribe) and proceed to grab any conception the original book threw at them and explain how &quot;no, that not how our tribe work you idiots&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd rather not see anything in the Revised book acknowledged as existing in the reality of the basic diegesis of the setting, personally. It'd be scrubbed out harder than the events of the BattleTech animated series (which became an animated series for kids in-universe, which two Clan Wolf warriors laugh about in the opening fiction of <i>Wars of Reaving</i>. <b>Curse you, Adam Steiner!</b>)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-18T20:52:22-07:00","id":1141647,"title":"","content":"Gifts and fetishes of the fallen fera, make them more distinct than off brand Spiral.<br /> <br /> Don't get me wrong I liked the W20 write ups, but some more crunch would be great.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-18T23:34:02-07:00","id":1141674,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1140039-w20-storytellers-vault-maybe?p=1141640#post1141640\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'd rather not see anything in the Revised book acknowledged as existing in the reality of the basic diegesis of the setting, personally. It'd be scrubbed out harder than the events of the BattleTech animated series (which became an animated series for kids in-universe, which two Clan Wolf warriors laugh about in the opening fiction of <i>Wars of Reaving</i>. <b>Curse you, Adam Steiner!</b>)</div> </div> </div> </div>As much fun as tearing it apart would be, best to just build something new on a better foundation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}